## Review notes
- Darwin: pre-flight accepts any IPv4 on an interface (ifconfig), including LAN_IP. Rancher Desktop cannot bind that (gate-1 failure), so BIND_IP=<LAN_IP> on the Mac passes pre-flight, `up` fails, and the rollback `up` reuses the same BIND_IP and fails too: stack down + manual restore block.
- Secrets: no sk-ant / private key / token= / secret-path patterns in `git diff main...HEAD`, spec.md or the gate-1 deploy log; .env.example holds placeholders only; server/.env (copy of live, 0600) is gitignored.

